1178164](https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB1178164) - Error encountered while connecting SAP \"Request failed with response: Couldn't find basic auth credential alias\"":[26,27],"#5) [KB0864448](https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0864448) - SAP reconciliation fails with error. Unable to match value '' with field 'sys\\_id' in the table 'samp\\_named\\_user\\_type'. Expecting type 'GUID'.":[28,29],"#6) [KB1632530](https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB1632530) - SAM - SAP - How reclamation for sap system users work":[30,31],"#7) [KB1548298](https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB1548298) - SAP - ITAM Product - Connection failed troubleshooting and other SAP common error details":[32,33],"#8) [KB1223612](https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB1223612) - SAP - ITAM - Reclamation candidates are not generating.":[34,35],"#9) [KB1639064](https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB1639064)  - ABAP - USMD\\_TT\\_TAB512 table type error while TR deployment at SAP system":[36,37],"#10) [KB1299127](https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB1299127) - SAM - SAP - download import template for Custom Price List and Named user Type":[38,39],"#11) The S\\_TOOLS\\_EX authorization is required so that the user activity table has usernames that are available without encryption.":[40,41],"#12) How to read ST03N datasets from DB | SAP Blogs":[42,43],"#13) Sap Table user activity table has usernames that are available without encryption.":[44,45],"#a.     Solution: S\\_TOOLS\\_EX profile is required for getting usernames from ST03N.":[46,47],"#14) SAP ABAP connection is failing and getting RC8 error while importing transport request.":[48,49],"#a.     Solution: Requirement - SAP NetWeaver 7.4, SAP\\_BASIS 740 and higher https://userapps.support.sap.com/sap/support/